  "description": "<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><strong>AVAKA is an innovative Electric Bike brand that provides affordable, reliable, and eco-friendly riding experiences. We believe in the power of cycling to change the way we move and live in our cities. We strive to create electric bikes that are not only affordable and reliable but also stylish, practical, and fun to ride.</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>We have launched a new model - <span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">AVAKA R1 Electric City Road Bike. It's an Electric City Bike featured with a powerful 250W brushless motor that has a star gear design to amplify torque and improve energy efficiency conversion rate, you can enjoy a smoother and faster ride while also conserving energy. The aluminum alloy Frame with durability and stability structure looks very elegant and beautiful, it is lighter than other electric bike. The design of the frame adds to the overall aesthetic appeal of the bike while also enhancing its performance. 18650 lithium battery is powerful and completely hidden in the bike frame, with waterproof and dust-proof. The power-assisted mode allows you to reach up to 80km of mileage, ensuring that you can go on longer travels without worrying about running out of battery in a short time.<br><br>Link to the product: <a href=\"https://avakabike.eu/products/avaka-r1-electric-rode-bike\">https://avakabike.eu/products/avaka-r1-electric-rode-bike</a><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">250W BRUSHLESS MOTOR</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">FASHIONABLE DESIGN, LIGHTWEIGHT AND PRACTICAL</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">HIGH-CAPACITY, WATERPROOF BATTERY</span></li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">27.5*1.26 Inches Tires</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mechanical Disc Brake</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Shimano 7-Speed Gears</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Smart LCD Display</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<p>Payment terms: Visa, MasterCard, Apple Pay, PayPal, Klarna</p>\r\nOther information: Fast &amp; Free EU Shipping, 1-Year Warranty, Live Chat Customer Service</div>",
